      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "坦克社学生各有独特天赋，战斗中招募进车组就会为车辆增加新能力。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Recruit Crews Each student in the tank club has unique talents. Recruiting them into your crew during battles will grant your vehicle new abilities.",
