      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "从不断扩充的二战车型中选车，再叠加数十种武器和升级带领本地坦克社取胜。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Select your vehicle from a growing list of historical models, then equip dozens of weapons and upgrades to lead your local tank club to victory! The Choice is Yours A growing selection of WWII tanks awaits, as you decide how to achieve victory on the field of battle.",
